<title>NEW ZEALAND: Blue Star sets NZ bid for McCollam.</title>
<headline>Blue Star sets NZ bid for McCollam.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue Star Investments, controlled by U.S. Office Products Co, on Friday said it intended to table a takeover bid at NZ$2.75 per share for all the capital of McCollam Printers Limited.</p>
<p>McCollam has approximately 21 million shares in issue, valuing the bid at about NZ$57.75 million.</p>
</text>
